[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; One variable: whether a glTF image takes its sidecar's texel passes. `leaf.png` is an opaque green
; square inside transparent texels whose colour is magenta. Godot imports the image through the
; texture importer, whose default alpha-border pass gives the transparent texels the green, so the
; blended, linearly filtered edge fades green. Without the pass it fades through magenta. Its alpha is
; hard. `unit-sprite-2d-soft-alpha-border` shows the pass on partial alpha.

